<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Silver Eagle shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Silver Eagle shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Silver Eagle Holdings Ltd was suspended on Thursday at the request of the company pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said.</p>
</text>
